  "new_actual_adjoint_obstruction": "Finite zero-supported q-binomial summation functional annihilates the finite-Laurent adjoint image and evaluates source monomials as complete row products. Unit rows force Omega(m) nonzero formal-weight residue sectors. Endpoint-only finite-Laurent reduction cannot erase them; no computational lower bound on jointly evaluating these sectors.",
